      {
        "_uid": "b4c8938b-8dce-a81a-7ff1-c6e9fc3dd25b",
        "date": "",
        "quote": "Forty-five participants of AKU's Challenge 'Scholarship' Programme got an opportunity to have a dialogue with Sharmeen Obaid-Chinoy - journalist, filmmaker, activist and the only Pakistani to win two Oscars. Watch what she told the students about her filmmaking skills, and lessons she learned in her life. #AKUChallenge   A post shared by Aga Khan University (@akuglobal) on Oct 25, 2017 at 3:26am PDT      Meet 'young Pakistan' at the Aga Khan University #AKUChallenge   A post shared by Aga Khan University (@akuglobal) on Oct 18, 2017 at 8:55am PDT",
